  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.7: Offline grace now lasts the full period the server signed (cacheValidUntil, 7 days) instead of being cut to 24 hours by the live-path replay window; a failed signature or integrity check no longer deletes the cached licence, so a single transient failure can no longer destroy the only offline artefact. Adds a second trusted central-key thumbprint, so replacing the signing key no longer requires every user to reinstall. Reports the plugin version to the platform on license validation (diagnostics only, no version gating).",
